    "title": "Thunder vs Nuggets highlights: Denver holds off OKC as Nikola Jokic, stars sit out",
    "text": "Updated April 10, 2026, 10:25 p.m. CTDENVER — Lu Dort and the OKC Thunder will face Tim Hardaway Jr. and the Denver Nuggets at Ball Arena on Friday night.OKC (64-16) clinched the top seed in the Western Conference with a 128-110 road win over the Los Angeles Clippers on Wednesday. Denver (52-28) secured a 136-119 home win over the Memphis Grizzlies on Wednesday.OKC has ruled out Shai Gilgeous-Alexander, Jalen Williams, Chet Holmgren, Isaiah Hartenstein, Cason Wallace, Alex Caruso, Ajay Mitchell, Isaiah Joe, Jaylin Williams and Thomas Sorber. Denver has also ruled out its entire starting five, including Nikola Jokic.Follow along for live updates throughout tonight's Thunder-Nuggets game:Order new book on Thunder's run to NBA titleThunder vs Nuggets score updates[ LISTEN UP: Make the \"Thunder Buddies\" podcast a staple of your starting lineup by following onApple,Spotify andYouTube. ]Final: Nuggets 127, Thunder 107 | Denver holds off OKC to stay in No. 3 seed spot out WestBranden Carlson: 23 points, 12 rebounds and 5 assistsNikola Topić: 14 points and 11 assistsKenrich Williams: 15 points and 12 boardsOKC (64-17) will finish its regular season with a home game against Phoenix at 7:30 p.m. CT Sunday.End of the third quarter: Nuggets 90, Thunder 85 | Denver maintains lead on OKCBranden Carlson: 17 points and 9 reboundsNikola Topić: 14 points and 8 assistsJared McCain: 15 points and 2 assistsHalftime: Nuggets 59, Thunder 51 | Denver leads in battle of reservesNikola Topić: 10 points and 2 assistsJared McCain: 10 points and 1 assistBranden Carlson: 8 points and 5 boardsJulian Strawther leads Denver with 15 points and 2 boards.End of the first quarter: Nuggets 34, Thunder 27 | Denver leads early without Nikola JokicNikola Topić: 7 points and 1 assistsAaron Wiggins: 6 points and 2 stealsKenrich Williams: 6 points and 1 boardWhat time is Thunder vs Nuggets game tonight?Date: Friday, April 10Time: 8 p.m. CTWhere: Ball Arena in DenverWatch Thunder vs Nuggets live on FuboWhat channel is OKC Thunder vs Denver Nuggets on tonight?TV: FanDuel Sports NetworkHow to watch online: Fubo (free trial)Thunder vs Nuggets predictions, picksJustin Martinez: Denver 108, OKC 105Both teams will be very short-handed for this game. But while OKC has already secured the top seed in the West, Denver still has something left to play for. It's third in the West with just a one-game lead over the Los Angeles Lakers and the Houston Rockets. I think that extra motivation will propel it to a victory.Thunder vs Nuggets betting oddsOdds via BetMGM as of Friday, April 10Odds: N/AOver/under: N/AMoneyline: N/AThunder vs Nuggets injury updatesThunder: Alex Caruso (rest) is out. Shai Gilgeous-Alexander (right oblique injury management) is out. Isaiah Hartenstein (left soleus injury management) is out. Chet Holmgren (low back spasms) is out. Isaiah Joe (left knee soreness) is out. Ajay Mitchell (left ankle injury management) is out. Thomas Sorber (right ACL surgical recovery) is out. Cason Wallace (left great toe soreness) is out. Jalen Williams (right hamstring injury management) is out. Jaylin Williams (right Achilles tendinitis) is out.Nuggets: Christian Braun (left ankle injury management and right hip flexor strain) is out. Aaron Gordon (right hamstring injury management) is out. Cameron Johnson (right ankle injury management) is out. Nikola Jokic (right wrist injury management) is out. Spencer Jones (right hamstring strain) is out. Jamal Murray (right shoulder impingement) is out. Peyton Watson (right hamstring strain) is out.Projected OKC Thunder startersJared McCainAaron WigginsLu DortKenrich WilliamsBranden CarlsonProjected Denver Nuggets startersBruce BrownTim Hardaway Jr.Julian StrawtherZeke NnajiJonas ValanciunasJustin Martinez covers the Thunder and NBA for The Oklahoman. Have a story idea for Justin? He can be reached at jmartinez@oklahoman.com or on X/Twitter at @Justintohoops. Sign up for the Thunder Sports Minute newsletter to access more 